            {
                "entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
                "word": "rurbain",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "76bd2f1d-7cc2-4165-b6bd-1fa95184d0d8",
                        "entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rurbains"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f084c354-bf50-460b-8126-1b2f74899a85",
                        "entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "rurbaine"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8bcf00a7-7b63-3bc8-ad42-3a5b3c4764ac",
                        "entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Habitant d’un village dont la proximité avec une grande ville crée un développement urbain de type banlieue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5699b6c-79cd-4f4c-ba44-daf91484188f",
                                "sense_id": "8bcf00a7-7b63-3bc8-ad42-3a5b3c4764ac",
                                "text": "C’est un comédien bordelais de 29 ans, David Mora, qui a obtenu le rôle de Fabien, un père inquiet, tchatcheur, rurbain et définitivement maladroit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38185eef-3d74-4310-8774-8aa1c835604a",
                                "sense_id": "8bcf00a7-7b63-3bc8-ad42-3a5b3c4764ac",
                                "text": "Les rurbains ont pu découvrir le monde agricole et discuter avec les hommes et les femmes qui les nourrissent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1f7791b-2bac-44ca-8ea9-9a8a9bed8028",
                                "sense_id": "8bcf00a7-7b63-3bc8-ad42-3a5b3c4764ac",
                                "text": "Le public visé est donc large, même si le concept cible en priorité les rurbains, les personnes qui vivent en banlieue pavillonnaire mais travaillent en ville."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14f5887d-bd89-4ac3-ac41-8aa6dfe84243",
                        "source_entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
                        "source_sense_id": "8bcf00a7-7b63-3bc8-ad42-3a5b3c4764ac",
                        "target_lang_word": "rurbanite",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rurbanite",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8138b1aa-abbf-3f77-813f-2a22eb8fcfe0",
                                        "entry_id": "5be4a28d-7220-3c08-b026-83865781631b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who lives in a rurban area; someone who lives in the country but works in the city."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d6a899b-1200-4e21-9d82-6a9edf8133df",
                                                "sense_id": "8138b1aa-abbf-3f77-813f-2a22eb8fcfe0",
                                                "text": "If you're a farmer in any Connecticut community the chances are that your next-door neighbor is a \"rurbanite.\" He lives in the country. He may call his home a \"farm,\" but he gets most of his income selling insurance, or working as a toolmaker in a brass factory, or teaching school or working on the road for the State Highway Department."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c6080c9-6e42-405f-8a38-54aaae5961fc",
                                                "sense_id": "8138b1aa-abbf-3f77-813f-2a22eb8fcfe0",
                                                "text": "The average citizen is now a \"rurbanite,\" owning a house on the outskirts of a city in an area where town and countryside have fused into TV-land."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f14bad7b-5bb7-4192-b63c-b3ce50926cf4",
                                                "sense_id": "8138b1aa-abbf-3f77-813f-2a22eb8fcfe0",
                                                "text": "People who make the choice to live “in the country” are in fact totally cut off from it. These “rurbanites” usually have to take the car to reach the neighboring woods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30de3ae2-962e-4dca-a5d9-99736c232aff",
                        "source_entry_id": "66941ed5-2bb4-35dd-99b9-8295dd714f69",
